          "source": "travel site · Mauritius day trips guide",
          "sourceUrl": "https://www.mauritius-travel.com/"
        }
      ],
      "insiderTip": "Best bang for your buck if you want the complete Le Morne marine experience — dolphins, healthy reefs, island vibes, and a BBQ lunch, all in one trip. Book the earliest departure (6–7 AM) for the best dolphin odds. Check operator reviews on TripAdvisor first.",
